# Belt-and-suspenders for the publish: real user data must NEVER ship to npm.
# (package.json `files` ships only synthetic sample data — fixtures/ with invented personas,
#  listings/example.yaml — plus <dir>/.gitkeep for the writable data dirs; this guards
#  against that list ever being loosened, and npm `files` + this exclusion are both applied.)
mirror/*
!mirror/.gitkeep
proposed/*
!proposed/.gitkeep
listings/*
!listings/example.yaml
endpoints.json
*.har
cookies*
*.cookies
.turbo
node_modules
